{"card":{"card_id":"ma-c-c585630e35eae0b06ece","statement":"Consider $M_\\cK(\\lambda)\\subseteq M_\\cM(\\lambda)$ in the obvious way. Since $[\\fH_X^+, \\cK^-]=0$ and $\\fH_X^+ \\cdot 1_\\lambda=0$, we have\n\n\\[\n\\fH_X^+\\cdot M_\\cK(\\lambda) = \\fH_X^+\\cdot \\bU(\\cK^-)\\otimes_{\\bU(\\cM^+\\oplus \\cH)} \\C_\\lambda=\\bU(\\cK^-)\\otimes_{\\bU(\\cM^+\\oplus \\cH)} \\fH_X^+\\cdot \\C_\\lambda=0.\n\\]\n\nIn particular, $\\fH_X^+$ acts trivially on $M_\\cK(\\lambda)$ (and hence on any subquotient of it).","source_id":"arXiv:1804.02563","cluster":"representation_theory","statement_sha256":"8e8120b874d34e907760ab64b72393224b859e055fdb5223d5a035bc2d83f2e1","kind":"remark","label":"Remark 25","ref_key":"","name":"","order":25,"deps":[],"cite_keys":[],"provenance":{"source_url":"https://arxiv.org/abs/1804.02563","harvest_mode":"arxiv_eprint","payload_sha256":"e37835a9f6b4274c653d65dc7a6ff66cac496d5a54d71d1e3faf4b1bf01adf27","line":1063,"origin":"latex_env","retrieved_at":"2026-09-29T14:16:48+08:00"},"wash":{"version":"cardwash.v3","stages":["segment","purify","classify","dedupe","emit"],"numbering":"document_order_with_label_heuristic","detail":{"stripped_proof":false,"chars":406,"math_hints":67}}},"paper":{"source_id":"arXiv:1804.02563","title":"Highest weight modules for affine Lie superalgebras","abstract":"We describe Borel and parabolic subalgebras of affine Lie superalgebras and study the Verma type modules associated to such subalgebras. We give necessary and sufficient conditions under which these modules are simple.","authors":["Lucas Calixto","Vyacheslav Futorny"],"year":"2018","url":"https://arxiv.org/abs/1804.02563","cluster":"representation_theory","macros":{"C":"\\mathbb{C}","Z":"\\mathbb{Z}","st":"\\mathrm{st}","nat":"\\mathrm{nat}","g":"\\mathfrak{g}","fm":"\\mathfrak{m}","fh":"\\mathfrak{h}","fn":"\\mathfrak{n}","fb":"\\mathfrak{b}","fsl":"\\mathfrak{sl}","fpsl":"\\mathfrak{psl}","fosp":"\\mathfrak{osp}","fgl":"\\mathfrak{gl}","fu":"\\mathfrak{u}","f